{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Darkroom Instrument",
    "chineseName": "暗房仪表",
    "version": "3.1",
    "date": "2026-10-19",
    "status": "Native V3.1 material and user-approved controls are implemented; visual acceptance remains pending. Additional detent-knob interactions remain deferred.",
    "target": "SwiftUI/macOS native app UI",
    "format": "Project-specific JSON token schema; not a DTCG/Figma import contract",
    "colorSpace": "sRGB",
    "dimensionUnit": "logical point (pt), except explicitly labeled physical pixels",
    "notes": [
      "Native SwiftUI material and interaction conventions do not change image processing.",
      "One continuous moulded enclosure; no panel cards and no repeated section-header gradients.",
      "Keys have a full-width face and a thin bottom sidewall, with no surrounding mounting well or cap inset.",
      "Neutral selected surfaces; selection uses key travel, bold label and a socketed orange indicator.",
      "All continuous numerical adjustments, including exposure and contrast, use horizontal faders. Only discrete modes retain concentric detent knobs.",
      "Viewing mats, image pixels and photo overlays remain independent of the enclosure.",
      "Opaque contrast pairs do not certify gradients, alpha compositing or rendered accessibility.",
      "Typography scaling options below are inherited design targets, not an implemented app-level type-size setting."
    ]
  },
